{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">TVB日前推出一連三集的《死有對証》番外篇「直男拍拖日常」，今集中「直男」高俊（馬貫東飾）面臨女友美寧（王菲飾）的死亡拷問。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">影片中，悉心打扮一番的王菲向男友拋出情侶間的經典「送命題」：「我今日有咩唔同？」「福爾摩斯」上身的馬貫東立刻拿出一疊女友的日常手繪畫像作對比，正當他自信滿滿回答「靚咗」，以為能順利過關之際，王菲隨即追問：「咁我邊度靚咗啊？」</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"b48a330c-8ac5-4163-9ddc-2a3b5be3e669.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026e6zNBbRgZn1791453226.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"b48a330c-8ac5-4163-9ddc-2a3b5be3e669.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"7f2aedb8-a08e-4e9c-9a0a-f2b72ecff274.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026KOfHDkJNME1791453225.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"7f2aedb8-a08e-4e9c-9a0a-f2b72ecff274.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"428bf3af-fb35-4d59-a59f-9223f5aab361.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026jxeQfGp5Ha1791453226.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"428bf3af-fb35-4d59-a59f-9223f5aab361.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">不料馬貫東竟直男式神回：「冇咁水腫，尤其係塊面！」一秒激嬲女友：「即係我尋日好腫啦！？」完全未懂收口的馬貫東更火上澆油補刀：「你前一日仲腫啊」，當場辣着女友令王菲憤然離去，場面非常搞笑。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T10:38:52.838473+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}